Platform marks
--------------

One-color vector marks drawn inside Cartouche to identify stores and consoles,
stored in app/Sources/NotProtonApp/Resources/Brand.xcassets. Marks taken from
Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org) are dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/): Steam
(mark-steam), Epic Games (mark-epic), GOG (mark-gog), PlayStation
(mark-playstation), PlayStation 2 (mark-playstation2), PlayStation Portable
(mark-psp), Sega (mark-sega) and Atari (mark-atari). The Amazon Games mark
(mark-amazon) is the one already drawn in mockup/launcher.html. Platform names
and logos belong to their owners; Cartouche uses them only to identify the
platforms.

Community data
